  Converted from the reference mock's SVG. The four photographs are clipped groups inside one
  group the mock dims to 55 %, so they read as being seen through the vault's own glass.

  The mock sets "AES-256" as live <text>; a vector drawable cannot hold text, so the label is
  traced here as a stroked outline at the mock's size, weight, and position.

  The blue family follows the theme accent; the photographs stay fixed.
-->
